---
import { profile } from '@/data/profile';
---

<header class="pointer-events-none fixed top-0 left-0 z-10 p-4 sm:p-6">
  <p class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-widest text-neon-cyan drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(0,240,255,0.7)]">
    {profile.name.toUpperCase()}
  </p>
  <p class="text-sm tracking-wide text-white/70">{profile.role}</p>
</header>

<aside
  class="pointer-events-none fixed bottom-0 left-0 z-10 p-4 text-xs tracking-wide text-white/60 sm:p-6 sm:text-sm"
  aria-label="Controls"
>
  <ul class="space-y-1 pointer-coarse:hidden">
    <li><kbd class="key">WASD</kbd> / <kbd class="key">Arrows</kbd> move · <kbd class="key">Shift</kbd> run</li>
    <li>Drag to look around · Click the ground to walk</li>
    <li><kbd class="key">E</kbd> enter / use · <kbd class="key">Esc</kbd> leave building</li>
    <li>Cans: <kbd class="key">E</kbd> pick up · hold <kbd class="key">F</kbd> to charge, release to throw · <kbd class="key">Q</kbd> drop</li>
  </ul>
  <ul class="hidden space-y-1 pointer-coarse:block">
    <li>Tap the ground to walk</li>
    <li>Drag to look · Joystick to steer</li>
    <li>Tap a door to go inside · tap cans, bins &amp; machines</li>
    <li>Hold Throw to charge a throw, release to let go</li>
  </ul>
</aside>

<style>
  @reference '@/styles/global.css';

  .key {
    @apply rounded border border-neon-cyan/40 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-display text-[0.65rem] text-neon-cyan;
  }
</style>
